## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Play a multiplayer game to checkmate → verify only ONE game-over overlay appears and XP is correct in profile.
2. Have one player quit mid-game → verify the staying player gets win XP exactly once, not looped.
3. Send a draw offer → let the game end via resignation → start a new game → verify no draw dialog appears.
4. Have one player quit and rejoin → verify no re-awarding of XP.
